 201          * Reentrant:
 202          *  No.
 203          *
 204          * Side Effects:
 205          *  Calling this function before I2C_DISPLAY_SaveConfig() or
 206          *  I2C_DISPLAY_Sleep() will lead to unpredictable results.
 207          *
 208          *******************************************************************************/
